==English==
{{wikipedia|Suicide attack}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[suicide]] [[bomber]]}}

# One who carries [[explosives]] on his or her [[body]] or in a [[vehicle]] and intends to [[detonate]] them to ensure [[maximum]] [[casualty]] of [[perceive]]d [[enemies]] and inflict [[widespread]] [[damage]]. Usually the [[attacker]] is [[motivate]]d by a [[political]] [[cause]] and is [[willing]] to die in the process.

====Related terms====
* [[suicide bomb]]
* [[suicide bombing]]

